// Dialog :
"P3934597892" "I'm grateful, {HeroName}. Perhaps more grateful than you can imagine. You see, I have some personal experience with the Council. I don't talk about it much, but you've shown me you're the kind of hero I can trust. Maybe I'll let you in on my secret before too long."
// RandomFameString :
"P2258928824" "{HeroName} rescued my wife from the Council!"

