// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P349927244" "Are you familiar with the reanimated monsters known as the Banished Pantheon? I certainly am. They've been digging up my churchyard, haunting the Morass, and generally making a nuisance of themselves. Yesterday I located a mausoleum full of the creatures. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you rid the mausoleum of these dread creatures?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3235629475" "Rid the mausoleum of the Banished Pantheon"
// SendOffString :
"P3711156467" "There was a time when I would have gone with you, {HeroName}, but I'm afraid those days are behind me now."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4260559586" "Defeat all zombies in mausoleum"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2855633153" "That mausoleum is still crawling with the undead."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P884295879" "A low, sickening groan meets your ears."

