// IntroString :
"P529459983" "Have you ventured deep into the Bonny Morass, {HeroName}? It can be a frightening place. The vampyri are firmly in control of Vampyr Mountain, and the Banished Pantheon roams the woods. It is a place not fit for man nor beast, but I'm going to send you there anyway. I have to. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If we are ever to reclaim Striga Isle, we must push the monsters back into their holes!</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2705207559" "Help Tobias reclaim Striga Isle"
// SendOffString :
"P2629215516" "I believe in you, {HeroName}. I believe you have what it takes to drive the unholy from Striga Isle."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2115110928" "Help reclaim Bonny Morass"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P109195905" "I'm counting on you to help me clear the Bonny Morass."

