// Dialog :
"P3118114936" "Thank you, hero. I know more about the monsters of this island than any other you will encounter. If you will continue to help me, there is a chance that you will learn more."
// RandomFameString :
"P165587764" "I heard {HeroName} cut a swath through the Bonny Morass!"

