// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4116829388" "How much do you know about the Banished Pantheon, {HeroName}? Do you know that they are constantly seeking a connection to the spirit world? Well, they are. And according to my sources, they may have just succeeded. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone's got to stop the Banished Pantheon from contacting the spirit world, {HeroName}.</a> If not, the world we know may soon not be worth living in."
// AcceptString :
"P4081003417" "Stop the Banished Pantheon from contacting the spirit world"
// SendOffString :
"P2425766012" "The foul zombies have created a portal with which to contact the denizens of the spirit world. Destroy that portal, or we will all suffer the consequences."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2037114891" "Destroy portal to spirit world"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3008130008" "The longer that portal remains open, the less likely it can ever be closed."

