"P3855936712" "I have need of your assistance, {HeroName}. I have located an old heirloom of mine, but I cannot retrieve it alone. You see, it is within Vampyr Mountain. If you would do me this personal favor, I believe I can open up Striga's secrets for you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you retrieve my heirloom from Vampyr Mountain?</a>"
